Usage: agent-deck pi-hooks <command>

Manage pi (pi-coding-agent) hook integration.

Installs an extension into pi's global extension directory that
forwards pi's lifecycle events to agent-deck, so a pi session's status
comes from real events instead of reading the pane.

Commands:
  install      Install or upgrade the agent-deck pi extension
  uninstall    Remove the agent-deck pi extension
  status       Show current pi extension install status
